9\. Design Principles
=====================

The shelf is the product
------------------------

Every feature should protect the visual bookshelf.

Speed over features
-------------------

Adding a book should feel instant.

Minimalism
----------

If something doesn't improve reading,

remove it.

Performance
-----------

